Main_Char: (I see someone walking around, I should say something to them.)
Main_Char: Um...Hi, I'm new here...
Baker (happy): Oh well hi there! How do you do!
Main_Char: I'm doing alright, I'm currently trying to meet more people in the village, so who are you?
Baker (happy): Haha I understand, my name is Betsy, I'm the town baker!
Main_Char: Nice to meet you! What type of things do you bake?
Baker (thinking): You were one of the crash victims weren't you? What a shame that was.
Main_Char: Uh..yes I was...
Baker (sad): The fact only three of you survived...how sad.
Baker (happy): Well never mind that...have some bread!
Main_Char: (The baker produces some bread from her bag and puts it in my arms)
Main_Char: (The bread is warm, as if recently taken out the oven.)
Main_Char: Oh! Um thank you!
Baker (happy): Go on! Eat it, let me know if you like it! It's an old family recipe.
Main_Char: (she motioned for me to eat the bread....)
Main_Char: (...and so I did, and it was the best bread I have ever tasted. If i didn't know it was bread, I would have thought it a drug.)
Main_Char: Wow! This is really good!
Baker (happy): Haha thank you, feel free to come get more later!
Main_Char: (as she said that, she turned and walked away)